flowchart TD
    A[Current Store State] --> D[Staff Operations Dashboard]
    B[Congestion Forecast] --> D
    C[Product Demand Forecast] --> D
    E[Inventory Alerts] --> D
    F[Decision Engine Recommendations] --> D

    D --> G[Current Store Overview]
    D --> H[Upcoming Events / Forecasts]
    D --> I[Prioritized Actions]
    D --> J[Historical Analytics]

    G --> G1[Traffic]
    G --> G2[Congestion Risk]
    G --> G3[Estimated Queue]
    G --> G4[Scan-and-Go Usage]
    G --> G5[Active Assisted Checkout]

    H --> H1[Predicted Congestion]
    H --> H2[Expected Customer Demand]
    H --> H3[Expected High-Demand Products]

    I --> I1[Prepare Assisted Checkout]
    I --> I2[Promote Scan-and-Go]
    I --> I3[Restock Product]
    I --> I4[Prepare Cold Stock]

    I1 --> K[Staff Action]
    I2 --> K
    I3 --> K
    I4 --> K

    K --> L[Mark / Record Action]
    L --> M[Outcome Event]
    M --> N[Updated Store State]
    N --> A

    J --> J1[Peak Periods]
    J --> J2[Average Waiting Time]
    J --> J3[Scan-and-Go Adoption]
    J --> J4[Transaction Volume]
    J --> J5[Top-Selling Products]
    J --> J6[Prediction / Action Performance]
